WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:05.150
- You know, I know that you had
a hard time with your father

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:08.580
and that he spanked you.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:11.590
And you know, I just want you to know

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:16.590
that's not gonna happen with me, okay?

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:21.056
And I promise I will never spank you.

00:00:21.056 --> 00:00:21.889
(hand smacks)

00:00:21.889 --> 00:00:22.942
Oh.

00:00:22.942 --> 00:00:25.859
♪ I don't need you ♪

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:29.790
- Well, we were behind each other in line

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:30.930
at the grocery store,

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:33.810
and it was silly, (giggles)

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:35.160
but I dropped a can of peas,

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.170
and he bent over to pick them up for me.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:40.263
And, that's where it started.

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:43.740
- What can I say?

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:44.970
It was love at first sight.

00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:47.193
And we've been together ever since.

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:50.243
- Well.

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:55.863
- Yes, she always has had
her own way of doing things.

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:00.353
(parents sighing)

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:03.173
- Okay.

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:06.480
I see what's going on here.

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:07.313
- Honey...

00:01:07.313 --> 00:01:09.180
- You don't approve of our engagement.

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:10.620
- No, they're not like that.

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:13.320
- I'm sorry, sweetheart.
Yes, they are like that.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:14.403
Look at their faces.

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:20.724
There's no point in trying
to reason with folks

00:01:20.724 --> 00:01:23.310
who can't appreciate the
differences in others.

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:25.576
