00:01:25.576 --> 00:01:28.076
(tense music)

00:01:29.402 --> 00:01:30.722
- (sighs) Honey, wait.

00:01:30.722 --> 00:01:33.139
(door thuds)

00:01:36.643 --> 00:01:37.870
